If you want the parts of app/engine.js that are Dear ImGui, JSON for Modern C++,
or Emscripten, take them from their upstream projects under their own terms
rather than from here.


7. Termination

This license ends automatically if you breach section 3 and do not put it right
within 30 days of being told about it. Section 2 survives, as stated there, and
so do sections 5 and 6.


8. Asking for Something Else

If you want to do something this license does not allow, ask. Contact
